(text "USB-C used as plain wires, no USB:\nVBUS = key VCC (console GP6, switched)\nD+ = SDA (GP4), D- = SCL (GP5)\nA6/B6 and A7/B7 are joined on the board,\nso a cable works either way up.\nCC1/CC2: 5.1k each to GND (USB-C's Rd).\nThe console's GP7 pull-up on CC reads low\nwhen a key is attached: that is DETECT.\nSBU1/SBU2 unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 119.38000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f55e3928-3def-4c47-a70d-00b8053f1519"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
